- [PriceDetailed](https://unpkg.com/@gravity-ui/page-constructor@8.23.5/build/docs/sub-blocks/PriceDetailed.md)
- [Quote](https://unpkg.com/@gravity-ui/page-constructor@8.23.5/build/docs/sub-blocks/Quote.md) — Renders a customer testimonial / quote card: a logo, the quote body, an optional author (name + avatar + description), and an optional CTA button. Paired with a large image on the side.

